{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はMJの収録でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新曲初披露しました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイトルは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『制服のマネキン』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1stの中田の個人PVを思いだすね(*・ω・)ノ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっきーなはいなかったけど(*_*)\nほぼ全員、32人で出ました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バックダンサーとして出させていただけて\n本当にありがたい(*´｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/05/1990139/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/05/1990139/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近変な夢ばっか見るんだよね(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悪夢ちゃん(ｃ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、悪夢じゃないんだー\nなんか朝から不快感が残るような(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...って書くと\nなんでもないのに\nみんな、病んでると思うのか\n「大丈夫？」コメントが増えるんだよね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかってる方々もいると思うけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田って\n基本、ネガティブな人間だから\nブログが若干暗いのはデフォルトだし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、\n病んでることは隠したい人間だから\n病んでる時こそブログに暗いこと書かないよ(・∀・)w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま、\nそう簡単に病まないけどねん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田のことをいつも気にしてくれてるのは\nありがたいことだけど\nみなさんを不安にさせる事が\n中田の辛くなる要因なんだ＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから把握よろ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/05/1990139/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃ、\n早いけどおやすみなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/05/1990139/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はいい夢見よ(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだな、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公演にキャン待ちで行ったら\n対内で1順だったくらいの\n幸せな夢を見よう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}